  "strategy": "Inquisitor Greyfax gives every other creature +1/+0 and vigilance, and the deck is built to put as many bodies behind that as it can. Squad creatures -- Arco-Flagellant, Space Marine Devastator, Vanguard Suppressor, Ultramarines Honour Guard and Zephyrim -- come with token copies of themselves for each extra payment, while Birth of the Imperium, Defenders of Humanity, Deploy to the Front, Launch the Fleet and Martial Coup make armies outright. Marneus Calgar draws a card whenever tokens enter and Skullclamp turns the small ones into more cards; Vexilus Praetor, Bastion Protector and The Golden Throne keep the commander and the player alive, and Swords to Plowshares, Mortify, Utter End, Fell the Mighty, Hour of Reckoning and Exterminatus clear the way.",
